        },
        {
          "text": "“Kweleko soni kwana ŵanace ŵa ayimwene wosope ŵa ku mpoto, ni ŵandu ŵa ku Sidoni. Ŵapite ku cilambo ca ŵandu ŵawe mwa soni, pamo ni ŵakuwulajidwa ku ngondo nipo ŵasicidwe ali ŵangakulupilila Mlungu. Kweleko akutenda soni yalumo ni wosope ŵaŵapite ku cilambo ca ŵandu ŵawe.”",
          "type": "text",
